{"id":47307,"ord":19,"n_segments":152,"prev":47306,"next":47308,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Harlem, the Cotton Club and Duke Ellington","title":"Playing in Atlanta in 1940 and Southern prejudice","category":"race_society","summary":"He was playing at a club in Atlanta and says the South was awfully prejudiced then.","period":"1940","year_from":1940,"year_to":1940,"words":132,"start":[27,6],"end":[28,8],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125#s47307","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Atlanta","focus":1,"type":"city","in":"Georgia"},{"name":"Georgia","focus":0,"type":"state"},{"name":"Plains","focus":0,"type":"city","in":"Georgia"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[],"story":{"theme":44,"theme_name":"Race and segregation in the jazz life","community":88,"community_name":"Segregation on the road and the bandstand","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":27,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"What were you doing in Plains for a month?"},{"p":27,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Huh?"},{"p":27,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"What were you doing in Plains? Hanging out, or --"},{"p":27,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"What was I doing?"},{"p":27,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"In Georgia."},{"p":27,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"What was I doing? Playing."},{"p":27,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Playing?"},{"p":27,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":27,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"1940?"},{"p":27,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":27,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"In Plains?"},{"p":27,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Plains."},{"p":27,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"In Plains, huh?"},{"p":27,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Not Plains, Georgia."},{"p":27,"b":20,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"No. You stayed in Plains."},{"p":27,"b":21,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I stayed."},{"p":27,"b":22,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Where were you playing, though,"},{"p":28,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Atlanta, or what town, do you remember?"},{"p":28,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Atlanta, Georgia."},{"p":28,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"It was a club in Atlanta."},{"p":28,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Huh?"},{"p":28,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Was it a club?"},{"p":28,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. The club that I played at in a -- oh, boy, I ain't done this in so long. Boy. Atlanta, Georgia. That's when they -- [they've changed]prejudice yet, but they was awful prejudiced."},{"p":28,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I was wondering what that was like, you know, 1940."},{"p":28,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, they was awful prejudiced."},{"p":28,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"That was Atlanta, though, you were in."}]}